[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0543","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0543.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12969","title":"Fluent Bit in_forward 输入插件身份认证绕过漏洞","description":"Fluent Bit 的 in_forward 输入插件在特定配置条件下未正确执行 security.users 认证机制。具有网络访问权限的远程攻击者可在暴露 forward 输入的 Fluent Bit 实例上发送未认证数据，绕过认证控制后注入伪造日志记录、向告警系统发起大量数据洪泛攻击，或操纵日志路由决策，从而严重影响所接收日志的真实性和完整性。该漏洞影响 Fluent Bit 4.0.0 至 4.1.0 版本，CVSS v3.1 评分为 6.5（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需权限和用户交互，仅对数据完整性造成部分影响。Fluent Bit 官方已在 v4.1.1 及向 v4.0 后移植的 v4.0.13 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12969"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-24T15:15:46Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:18Z","remediation":"立即将 Fluent Bit 升级至 v4.1.1 或 v4.0.13 及以上版本，该版本已修复 in_forward 插件的用户认证绕过漏洞（PR #10973）。升级后需检查配置文件，确保在启用 security.users 时同时配置 shared_key 或 empty_shared_key，否则服务启动将报错并拒绝加载。若暂无法升级，可通过防火墙规则限制仅允许可信 IP 访问 in_forward 监听端口（如 24224/9880），并禁用未使用 in_forward 的实例以缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://fluentbit.io/blog/2025/10/28/security-vulnerabilities-addressed-in-fluent-bit-v4.1-and-backported-to-v4.0/","https://www.oligo.security/blog/critical-vulnerabilities-in-fluent-bit-expose-cloud-environments-to-remote-takeover","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b328bc09980ed1c829df312deb1700fa6b961e03/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12969.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ddbd6331b567a408d81e08f1f3b48bff256075bf/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12969.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c3259b0cbf17b142c0e516420bc21bb303a8efff/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12969.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c3259b0cbf17b142c0e516420bc21bb303a8efff/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12969.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12969.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12969.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6a2b2a4b8df5513f296f3b55b8d745d51fd48baf/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-129xx/CVE-2025-12969.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6e362f6959b500f9e0530cd95885d05afaa93bae/2025/CVE-2025-12969.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2025-12969","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2025-12969"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0543.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0542","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0542.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12889","title":"wolfSSL TLS 1.2 摘要算法降级漏洞","description":"TLS 1.2 协议在握手过程中存在摘要算法降级漏洞。当客户端与服务器建立 TLS 1.2 连接时，客户端可选择使用比服务器 CertificateRequest 中指定更弱的摘要算法，而非遵循服务器要求的摘要算法列表。该漏洞影响 wolfSSL 等实现了 TLS 1.2 协议的软件库，攻击者需位于同一网络且拥有低权限，无需用户交互即可触发。成功利用可导致连接层面机密性和完整性降低，使通信内容面临被窃听或篡改的风险，wolfSSL 已通过合并上游拉取请求修复该问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12889"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-22T00:15:54Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:09Z","remediation":"升级 wolfSSL 至 5.8.4 或更高版本，该补丁在 https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9395 修复了 TLS 1.2 握手过程中客户端可绕过 CertificateRequest 中指定的摘要算法限制、降级使用较弱摘要的问题。如暂无法升级，可临时通过配置禁用 TLS 1.2 并强制使用 TLS 1.3，或通过 WOLFSSL\\_NO\\_OLD\\_TLS 等编译选项阻止旧版 TLS 协议回退。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9395","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0f553384dd20c92d2e4bbb015c4ced774f3a6ee4/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12889.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6960c4054f20c0ddbadc97b3aac2c589a52297d1/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12889.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/67be6bea6496da8a804762a44a5511dd58ba8aa3/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12889.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/e5df0acbfed944bf572f46f0f4302bbc5bf186dd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12889.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb08d587b27dcd0a9e0b92e9e800aa206489e72b/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12889.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/67be6bea6496da8a804762a44a5511dd58ba8aa3/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12889.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb08d587b27dcd0a9e0b92e9e800aa206489e72b/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12889.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12889.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12889.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-12889.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0542.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0541","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0541.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12888","title":"wolfSSL X25519 恒定时间实现时序侧信道漏洞","description":"X25519 密钥交换算法的\"恒定时间\"实现在基于 Xtensa 架构的 ESP32 芯片上存在时间侧信道漏洞（CWE-203）。由于编译器优化与 CPU 架构限制，Xtensa 编译器可能生成非常量时间执行的汇编代码，导致加密运算的执行时间随密钥位模式产生可观测差异。攻击者若能在物理接触或本地环境条件下对目标设备进行高精度的计时测量，并具备一定的访问权限，则可能通过分析 X25519 密钥协商过程中的时间差异逐步推导或重现私钥，进而伪造签名或解密通信内容。该漏洞影响使用 wolfSSL 5.8.4 之前版本且面向 Xtensa/ESP32 平台的 X25519 实现。wolfSSL 已在 5.8.4 版本中默认启用 Xtensa 平台的低内存 X25519 实现并引入盲化（blinding）措施以缓解此侧信道风险。","severity":"LOW","score":1.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12888"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-21T23:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:09Z","remediation":"将 wolfSSL 升级到 5.8.4 或更高版本。根据 wolfSSL 于 2025 年 11 月 20 日发布的 5.8.4 版本公告，该版本默认在 Xtensa 架构（ESP32 芯片）上启用小型代码尺寸实现（CURVE25519_SMALL/ED25519_SMALL/CURVE448_SMALL/ED448_SMALL），以修复 X25519 恒定时间实现中的时序侧信道问题。对于无法立即升级的环境，可在编译配置中手动启用上述 SMALL 宏，或通过 NO_CURVE25519_BLINDING 等编译选项禁用易受攻击的实现路径。建议同时关注 Espressif 官方 ESP-IDF 安全更新，确保 SDK 中的 wolfSSL 组件版本不低于 5.8.4。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9275","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/85173a2e1318ed569ebbe0f7c0fd4da41967760d/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12888.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/14b4c0853017106655e109e69fb1d34bc5e08a94/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12888.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6392b489ed3a7669c609bae10325f1a166410f3/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12888.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/e5df0acbfed944bf572f46f0f4302bbc5bf186dd/data/2025/CVE-2025-12888.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/54b256cb2952e60dcd1a90ef7455fbfb2b786625/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-12888.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e6392b489ed3a7669c609bae10325f1a166410f3/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-12888.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/54b256cb2952e60dcd1a90ef7455fbfb2b786625/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-12888.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-12888.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-12888.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-12888.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0541.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0493","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0493.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11936","title":"wolfSSL wolfSSL TLS 1.3 KeyShareEntry 解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"wolfSSL v5.8.2 的 TLS 1.3 KeyShareEntry 解析存在输入验证不当漏洞。远程未认证攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含同一支持组的多个重复 KeyShareEntry 值的特制 ClientHello 消息，触发该漏洞，导致服务器在处理 ClientHello 期间消耗大量 CPU 和内存资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 wolfSSL v5.8.2 的多平台系统，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11936"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-21T23:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:26Z","remediation":"升级 wolfSSL 至 v5.8.2 之后的版本（如 v5.9.0 或包含 PR #9117 修复的最新版本），该版本在 TLS 1.3 KeyShareEntry 解析中增加了对同一组重复 KeyShareEntry 的输入校验。如无法立即升级，可在服务端配置中禁用 TLS 1.3 协议，回退至 TLS 1.2 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl","https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9117","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11936.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11936.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11936.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11936.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11936.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-11936.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-11936.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11936.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11936.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11936.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0493.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0491","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0491.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11934","title":"wolfSSL TLS 1.3 CertificateVerify 签名算法降级漏洞","description":"wolfSSL 在 TLS 1.3 协议的 CertificateVerify 签名算法协商过程中存在输入验证不当漏洞（CWE-20）。攻击者可通过在 TLS 握手阶段操纵客户端与服务器之间的签名算法协商过程，将签名算法降级至强度更低的算法。例如，当客户端声称支持 ECDSA P521 时，服务器可能错误地接受 ECDSA P256 作为协商结果，导致后续连接使用安全性较弱的 P256 曲线进行签名验证。该漏洞影响 wolfSSL 5.8.2 及之前版本，涵盖多种操作系统平台。虽然该漏洞被评定为低危（CVSS 2.1），但在特定场景下可能削弱 TLS 连接的加密强度，攻击者需具备高权限才能利用。建议用户及时升级 wolfSSL 至修复该漏洞的最新版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11934"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-21T23:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:26Z","remediation":"升级 wolfSSL 至 5.8.4 或更高版本（2025 年 11 月 20 日发布），该版本已包含 PR #9113 的修复，在 TLS 1.3 CertificateVerify 阶段增加了对签名算法的校验，防止服务端将客户端声明的高安全级别算法（如 ECDSA P521）降级为低安全级别算法（如 ECDSA P256）。若无法立即升级，可通过编译时禁用 TLS 1.3 支持（移除 --enable-tls13 编译选项）或仅允许使用单一签名算法族来降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl","https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9113","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11934.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11934.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11934.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11934.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11934.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-11934.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-11934.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11934.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11934.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-11934.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0491.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0490","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0490.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11933","title":"wolfSSL TLS 1.3 CKS扩展输入验证不当拒绝服务漏洞","description":"wolfSSL 5.8.2 及更早版本在解析 TLS 1.3 CKS（Certificate Key Status）扩展时存在输入验证不当漏洞。远程未认证攻击者可通过向目标服务发送特制的包含重复 CKS 扩展的 ClientHello 消息，触发解析逻辑异常，导致服务进程崩溃或进入不可用状态，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 wolfSSL 库的多平台系统，攻击者无需任何身份认证即可发起攻击，攻击复杂度较低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11933"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-21T23:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:26Z","remediation":"升级到 wolfSSL 5.8.4 或更高版本。该漏洞已在 PR #9132 中修复，补丁于 2025 年 8 月 26 日合并到 master 分支，并随 5.8.4 版本（2025 年 11 月 20 日发布）正式发布。建议用户立即更新到最新稳定版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl","https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9132","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11933.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11933.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11933.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-11933.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-11933.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11933.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11933.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11933.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-11933.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-11933.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0490.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0489","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0489.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11932","title":"wolfSSL wolfSSL PSK Binder 验证定时侧信道信息泄露漏洞","description":"wolfSSL TLS 1.3 服务器实现中存在定时侧信道漏洞，该漏洞源于服务器在验证 PSK（Pre-Shared Key）binder 时使用了非常量时间的比较方法。攻击者可通过精确测量服务器处理 PSK binder 的响应时间差异，推断出 PSK binder 的有效字节信息，从而进行侧信道分析攻击。该漏洞影响使用 wolfSSL 库且启用了 TLS 1.3 PSK 认证模式的服务端，需要攻击者具备网络访问能力和低级别权限（如可发起 TLS 握手的合法客户端），并能执行主动攻击（AT:P）。由于 CVSS 评分仅为 2.3（低危），实际利用难度较高，但在特定高安全性场景下仍可能构成威胁。wolfSSL 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，采用常量时间比较函数替代原有实现。","severity":"LOW","score":2.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11932"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-21T23:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:26Z","remediation":"升级 wolfSSL 至 5.8.4 或更高版本，该版本已包含 PR #9223 的修复，将 PSK binder 验证从非常量时间的 XMEMCMP 替换为 ConstantCompare。可通过源码编译安装最新稳定版，或从 wolfSSL 官方下载页面获取 5.8.4+ 版本包。若无法立即升级，可在 TLS 服务端配置中禁用 PSK 密码套件作为临时缓解措施，避免使用 TLS 1.3 PSK 模式进行身份验证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11932.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11932.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11932.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-11932.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-11932.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11932.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11932.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11932.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-11932.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-11932.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0489.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0488","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0488.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11931","title":"wolfSSL XChaCha20-Poly1305 整数下溢导致越界访问漏洞","description":"wolfSSL 的 XChaCha20-Poly1305 解密函数 wc_XChaCha20Poly1305_Decrypt() 中存在整数下溢漏洞（CWE-191），导致越界内存访问。该漏洞不涉及 TLS 连接，仅在应用程序直接调用该解密函数时触发。攻击者可通过向目标应用提交特制的密文数据触发整数下溢，造成越界读取或写入，可能导致敏感信息泄露或程序崩溃。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，利用需要用户交互且攻击复杂度较高。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11931"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-21T23:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:25Z","remediation":"升级 wolfSSL 至包含 PR #9223 修复的版本（≥5.7.6），该 PR 修复了 `wc_XChaCha20Poly1305_Decrypt()` 函数中的整数下溢导致越界访问问题。如无法立即升级，避免在应用中直接调用该解密函数，或在使用前对输入长度参数进行严格校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9223","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11931.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11931.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11931.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-11931.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-11931.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d2f32d8750bd50219425137a8fc56ab841cc707b/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11931.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11931.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-11931.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-11931.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-11931.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0488.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0492","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0492.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11935","title":"WolfSSL wolfSSL TLS 1.3 前向保密违规漏洞","description":"WolfSSL 的 TLS 1.3 预共享密钥（PSK）实现中存在前向保密违规漏洞。当客户端发送包含 psk_dhe_ke 但缺少 key_share 扩展的 ClientHello 时，恶意或故障的服务器可忽略客户端对完美前向保密（PFS）的请求，导致连接继续使用不含 PFS 的 PSK 会话。这降低了 TLS 连接的安全性，使得攻击者若获取了会话密钥，可解密过去捕获的通信内容。该漏洞影响使用 WolfSSL 库且启用 TLS 1.3 PSK 的系统，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 6.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11935"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-21T22:16:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:31:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 WolfSSL 至 5.8.4 及以上版本（该版本包含 PR #9112 的修复，强制客户端执行 onlyDhPskKe 标志检查）。如无法立即升级，可在编译时使用 --onlyPskDheKe 选项启用 PSK DHE 密钥交换强制前向保密，或在应用层禁用 TLS 1.3 PSK 会话复用作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl","https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl/pull/9112","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11935.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11935.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11935.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-11935.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/1c2e0105dfc8043b137c91cc2d5ac23317d19c53/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-11935.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4c26ebbfb2437ed90b3e4375ee155f638be2c4bd/data/2025/CVE-2025-11935.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-11935.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/a1acf6bc1c1b77dc8e27e29a9babd16bcf6eb3a9/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11935.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-11935.json","https://github.com/anchore/cve-data-enrichment/blob/1c0dfd8c28507756be9a283d40cf1d9bdcdb241c/data/anchore/2025/CVE-2025-11935.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0492.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0460","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0460.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-11230","title":"HAProxy mjson 库拒绝服务漏洞","description":"tags.<value>HAProxy 的 mjson JSON 解析库存在算法复杂度缺陷（CWE-407），远程攻击者可发送精心构造的 JSON 请求触发低效算法，导致目标服务拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用受影响 mjson 版本的 HAProxy 部署，包括 SUSE Linux Enterprise Server 15 和 openSUSE 15 等系统。攻击无需身份认证，通过向 HAProxy 发送特制的 JSON 数据即可触发资源耗尽，造成服务不可用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-11230"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-19T10:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:29:53Z","remediation":"立即将 HAProxy 升级至 2.8.16 或更高版本。该漏洞影响所有 2.4 及以上版本中集成 mjson JSON 解码器的 HAProxy，仅有升级可彻底修复。若使用 HAProxy 3.x 分支，请升级至 3.3.0 或更新版本。如暂时无法升级，可在 HAProxy 配置中对 JSON 请求体设置大小上限（如在 frontend 中添加 `tune.bufsize` 限制），或通过 WAF/反向代理层拦截包含异常大型 JSON 数值的请求，作为临时缓解措施。同时监控 NVD 和 HAProxy 官方邮件列表获取最新安全公告。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.haproxy.com/blog/october-2025-cve-2025-11230-haproxy-mjson-library-denial-of-service-vulnerability","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-11230.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11230.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/e7ffe335b9e43de0462b999586e11c70c219af1c/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-11230.json","https://github.com/bigwhite/gopherdaily/blob/2df6fc63d92c74399631b0fe60f3ae1c1d7301d8/202510/issue-20251004.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-11230","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e3454357078cf368426374d4a62627b3db36a838/2025/11xxx/CVE-2025-11230.json","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/59370880a06b381c063ab200d3efef5016493e80/app/routes/posts/2025-11-19_CVE-2025-11230.mdx","https://github.com/jcmoraisjr/haproxy-ingress/blob/14ea46fba7972eabee71df556cbfe9812403973d/CHANGELOG/CHANGELOG-v0.16.md","https://github.com/chef/chef-web-docs/blob/5c587207fde2a7a3842bee259785fdbcecb1fedb/content/release_notes/automate.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-fc36-5gc3-jmhx/GHSA-fc36-5gc3-jmhx.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0460.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0460.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0460.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0424","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0424.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-10158","title":"Rsync rsync 堆缓冲区越界读取漏洞","description":"Rsync 文件同步工具中存在数组索引验证缺陷，恶意客户端作为文件传输接收方时，可通过构造负数的数组索引触发堆缓冲区越界读取，导致信息泄露。攻击者需至少拥有对远程 rsync 模块的读取权限才能利用该漏洞。该漏洞影响 Rsync 3.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。官方已通过提交 797e17fc 修复此问题，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-10158"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-18T15:16:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:27:47Z","remediation":"升级 rsync 至包含 commit 797e17fc 的修复版本（如 rsync ≥ 3.4.1 且包含该补丁）。各发行版用户：Gentoo 升级至 rsync-3.4.1-r2，Alpine Linux 升级至对应修复版本，SUSE SLES12 安装 SUSE-SU-2026:2048-1 安全更新。如无法立即升级，在 rsyncd.conf 中对模块设置 `read only = yes` 并限制 `hosts allow` 仅允许可信来源连接，降低恶意客户端触发漏洞的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://attackerkb.com/assessments/fbacb2a6-d1cd-4011-bb3a-f06b1c8306b1","https://github.com/RsyncProject/rsync/commit/797e17fc4a6f15e3b1756538a9f812b63942686f","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2025/CVE-2025-10158.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10158.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-10158.json","https://github.com/microsoft/azurelinux/blob/db4dceaf9bd186cb20f62c3a43615b9421200bed/specs/r/rsync/rsync.spec","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2025-10158","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/12b56937c03071ca373f3f6a59d2f43e819052a3/2025/10xxx/CVE-2025-10158.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/a776c2f93aca32bd4efdcb44fddb0c44dc7e1c5a/main/rsync/APKBUILD","https://github.com/gentoo/gentoo/blob/5c5c224fb2cac410643a4d547e71426e4da756ce/net-misc/rsync/rsync-3.4.1-r2.ebuild","https://github.com/flatcar/scripts/blob/9daca039e01aed3ca2e1403b119c6164c0b5037a/changelog/security/2026-03-04-weekly-updates.md","https://github.com/mobiaqua/yocto/blob/62073e0493961867d42d4d9fcc0003700308c640/meta/recipes-devtools/rsync/files/CVE-2025-10158.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0424.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0040","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-8693","title":"Zyxel DX3300-T0 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"Zyxel DX3300-T0 固件版本 5.50(ABVY.6.3)C0 及之前版本存在操作系统命令注入漏洞，经过认证的攻击者可通过向 CGI 程序的 \"priv\" 参数注入恶意操作系统命令，在目标设备上以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞允许攻击者完全控制受影响设备，危害等级高（CVSS 8.8），建议用户立即升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-8693"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-11-18T02:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T10:07:27Z","remediation":"立即将 Zyxel DX3300-T0 固件升级至 5.50(ABVY.6.4)C0 或更高版本（联系 Zyxel 技术支持获取固件文件）。如无法立即升级，确保设备 WAN 访问保持默认关闭状态，并设置强密码且定期更换，防止攻击者通过认证后利用 priv 参数注入操作系统命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.zyxel.com/global/en/support/security-advisories/zyxel-security-advisory-for-uncontrolled-resource-consumption-and-command-injection-vulnerabilities-in-certain-4g-lte-5g-nr-cpe-dsl-ethernet-cpe-fiber-onts-security-routers-and-wireless-extenders-11-18-2025","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/24df5d59670dfe04b9c86de11fa86df63c0d28f7/cves/2025/8xxx/CVE-2025-8693.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ce62c4fb53e185987a087a07544538a62587799/2025/8xxx/CVE-2025-8693.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-2025-8693.md","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/b547e7e64a92ccf9b100bfc2bc6b038613fd13a7/app/routes/posts/2025-11-18_CVE-2025-8693.mdx","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/7f9d328c5fbc6b96e5e86ea6c9dab85e4e384533/docs/2026/Zyxel_DX3300-T0_%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2025-8693.toml","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/4544d3857250fe21711ce8febf38e8822729678f/advisories/unreviewed/2025/11/GHSA-jvj8-73h8-vqf9/GHSA-jvj8-73h8-vqf9.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/228df6a85079f5c6b1ecdfb3d41be685458438ef/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-8693.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/d2db0569df181d5506cd0b443d26007c2bff1c8a/CVEs_log/2025-11-19_zh.md","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/d6b8c0f3c049bc3b4d8d2295343fd57cd045bab9/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2025-11-19_09-29-24.md","https://github.com/Vulnogram/Vulnogram.github.io/blob/8217b89fdf690dcc563cba34f021c6fbb19c3935/rss/zyxel.xml","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-8693"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0040.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0554","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0554.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13230","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆漏洞","description":"Google Chrome V8 JavaScript 引擎存在类型混淆漏洞（CWE-843），影响 142.0.7444.59 之前版本。攻击者可构造恶意 HTML 页面，诱导受害者访问触发 V8 引擎中的类型混淆，进而导致堆内存损坏。攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需权限（PR:N），但需要用户交互（UI:R），成功利用可导致高机密性、完整性、可用性影响（C:H/I:H/A:H），CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（HIGH）。攻击者需诱导用户访问精心构造的恶意网页即可触发漏洞，可能导致远程代码执行。Google Chrome 142.0.7444.59 及更高版本已修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13230"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-18T00:15:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:43Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 142.0.7444.59 或更高版本（通过设置→关于 Chrome 自动更新）。若暂时无法升级，可在 chrome://flags 中启用 \"Site Isolation\" 并禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，或使用浏览器隔离/沙箱方案限制渲染进程权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_28.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/446124892","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-13230.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13230.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13230.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13230.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-13230.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13230.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13230.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13230.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13230.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13230.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0554.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0553","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0553.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13227","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆漏洞","description":"这是 Google Chrome V8 引擎中的类型混淆漏洞，攻击者通过精心构造的 HTML 网页触发类型混淆漏洞，导致堆内存破坏并可能实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有低于 142.0.7444.59 版本的 Chrome 浏览器，任何用户无需身份验证即可访问恶意网页，但需要用户交互。该漏洞可让攻击者完全控制受害者的浏览器进程，实现读取、修改或删除任意内存数据，直接危害用户的数据和隐私安全。CVSS 评分 8.8，属于高危严重漏洞。谷歌已在 2025 年 11 月的安全更新中修复此问题，用户应及时更新至最新版本以获取保护。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13227"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-18T00:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:43Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 至 142.0.7444.59 或更高版本（通过菜单→帮助→关于 Google Chrome 自动更新）。若暂时无法升级，可在设置→隐私和安全→网站设置→JavaScript 中禁用 JavaScript，或仅允许受信任站点运行脚本作为临时缓解措施，并避免访问不明链接。企业用户可通过组策略强制推送 Chrome 更新策略至所有终端。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_28.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/446122633","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-13227.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13227.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13227.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13227.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-13227.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13227.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13227.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13227.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-2025-13227.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2025-13227.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0553.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0553.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0553.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0552","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0552.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13226","title":"Google Chrome V8 类型混淆导致堆损坏漏洞","description":"Google Chrome V8 引擎存在类型混淆漏洞（CWE-843），攻击者可通过构造恶意 HTML 页面诱导用户访问，触发 V8 引擎中的类型混淆导致堆损坏，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 142.0.7444.59 之前的所有版本，CVSS 3.1 评分 8.8（HIGH），攻击向量为网络（AV:N），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需特权（PR:N），但需要用户交互（UI:R），可导致高机密性、完整性和可用性影响（C:H/I:H/A:H）。攻击者需诱导受害者访问精心构造的恶意网页即可触发漏洞，Google 已在 Chrome 142.0.7444.59 版本中修复该漏洞，用户应尽快升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13226"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-11-18T00:15:47Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:33:42Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Google Chrome 升级至 142.0.7444.59 或更高版本（通过 Chrome 菜单→帮助→关于 Google Chrome 自动更新），或在企业环境中通过组策略强制推送更新。若暂时无法升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施，但会影响网页功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2025/10/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_28.html","https://issues.chromium.org/issues/446113732","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2025/CVE-2025-13226.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13226.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c16d5de75824639ce100418081f1869662c7d360/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13226.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-13226.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/e2fbb25cf36dd17c3ff796c21d6f98188851fe27/pocs/2025/CVE-2025-13226.md","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/55f246b77910d3f4b9407285be2bf5a1d8726efb/data/2025/CVE-2025-13226.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/f52824ab85b4a56207060d8a0fb7319df7a49552/vex/cve/2025/CVE-2025-13226.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-13226.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2025/CVE-